(5113,'fr',11,'newbadgedeprecated','You have been redirected from badges/newbadge.php. Please note that badges/newbadge.php will be removed in the near future.\n<br/>Update links and bookmarks to use the current page badges/edit.php.','Vous avez été redirigé depuis badges/newbadge.php. La page badges/newbadge.php sera supprimée prochainement.\n<br />Veuillez modifier les liens et signets, en utilisant la page actuelle badges/edit.php.',NULL,1792162273,NULL,0,0),
