(24677,'fr',168,'privacy:metadata:enrol_paypal:enrol_paypal:parent_txn_id','In the case of a refund, reversal, or cancelled reversal, this would be the transaction ID of the original transaction.','En cas de remboursement ou d’annulation, l’identifiant de la transaction originale.',NULL,1792162278,NULL,0,0),
